# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# HindiMitra is a single-page app — React Navigation handles every
# route on the client. Without this redirect, hitting a deep link
# (e.g., https://hindimitra.app/teacher/dashboard) would 404 because
# the Pages CDN looks for a literal file at that path.
#
# Format: <from>  <to>  <status>
# /*  /index.html  200    →  serve index.html for every URL with a
#                            200 (not a redirect), so the URL stays the
#                            same and React Navigation picks up the
#                            route from window.location.

/*    /index.html    200
